WEBVTT

00:04:29.954 --> 00:04:33.996
that offer paid family leave
report a positive impact on morale,

00:04:33.996 --> 00:04:36.371
and 70 percent notice
a boost in productivity.

00:04:37.204 --> 00:04:38.996
It’s a positive for any company,

00:04:38.996 --> 00:04:40.996
and that brings me to my final point.

00:04:41.454 --> 00:04:42.496
Paternity leave --

00:04:42.496 --> 00:04:43.788
it’s good for society.

00:04:44.038 --> 00:04:46.663
Paternity leave is one of the big
steps we can make

00:04:46.663 --> 00:04:49.454
in giving partners the opportunity
to share the work

00:04:49.454 --> 00:04:51.038
both at home and at work.

00:04:51.121 --> 00:04:54.163
It’s one of our best bets
to bridge the gender gap overall.

00:04:54.288 --> 00:04:57.579
Research shows that when
that gender gap gets smaller,

00:04:57.579 --> 00:04:59.579
people report higher life satisfaction.

00:04:59.663 --> 00:05:03.038
Iceland, Norway and Finland
ranked top three